<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - March 17.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - March 17.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    92/94     98/100     UNQ     203/211</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   95/99    102/105   198/203   210/215</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker prices edged up on Monday on the back of firm cargo and strong crude values but traders saw limited room for further gains. &quot;The high prices may not last long because still not many buyers emerged,&quot; said one trader. Suppliers could be forced to lower their offers like they did last week when prices slid, he said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
